# Cursor Rules for baifa-api

Operational Rules:
- NEVER run tests or `./vendor/bin/pint` automatically. Only run them when the user explicitly requests it.
- NEVER run php or composer on the host. Always use `docker compose exec app ...`.
- Save all business rules requested by the client in `docs/business_rules.md`.
- Keep `docs/openapi.yaml` and `README.md` updated when modifying endpoints.

Code Architecture:
- Laravel RESTful API with `/api/v1/` prefix.
- User roles: client, employee, manager, admin (`App\Enums\UserRole`).
- Form Requests in `app/Http/Requests/`.
- API Resources in `app/Http/Resources/`.